<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli drones struck a Syrian operative planning attacks for Iran near the Lebanon border, while Syrian security forces intensified anti-ISIS operations, pursued former regime loyalists, and engaged private security firms linked to a new Syrian security mogul, also foiling drug-smuggling attempts on the Iraq and Jordan borders. The UN Security Council urged Israel to respect the 1974 Disengagement Agreement and to end incursions into southern Syria. Houthi forces attacked Riyadh's King Khalid Airport, killing 12 and injuring 309. 2,732 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;GOV.UK&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPYlpsSVZ5UVhfMUpzMHRXV2taNlBZNjFGWFRtZDRxZmNPTVI2VU5HdlFpVlJsQUpSd3g3Q1dwTlBHQUo4Ynl2cmRKOTBxSU5XR1d0Y3VSQzdkSkZyaHJlVTYyTWgyOGNva2Vxam5SNUdpQkNmdHVFemZ3RGVWZG9TRjNGYVRGamNa?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTFBKX210OTB0SFlGVWZsNS13eWExb3ljM29fUGlSaFM4NGxZR1BZZkV2WHlzTEpzTWJ3U3NwSG9XV3VJeTdxTVRGU3BmbVdfaGszak1R0gFTQVVfeXFMUEpfbXQ5MHRIWUZVZmw1LXd5YTFveWMzb19QaVJoUzg0bFlHUFlmRXZYeXNMSnNNYndTc3BIb1dXdUl5N3FNVEZTcGZtV19oazNqTVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;نون بوست&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Alma Research and Education Center&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPVzNma2paNU93cjljQ21Rc0pLdFc3X2V1WnBwYWZGQVVlZVpHd1RlbHctLWE2cGlCX0ROVTYwbXU0elNlSi1ZdEF0cDZ5ano5WlFPSHJxN290QWZrb3NBb28xd2plMk5WNFZGVmwyTnZWY0pmNXFOZmlzR1BpRE83UGNpbC0tVWlWWE9PR0tQ